Interpreted version
===================

elan matchingAC ctesig


Compiled version
================

elanc matchingAC ctesig ; gmake --file matchingAC.make ; a.out


Equations
=========

x + y <=AC a + b + c end

x + y <=AC a + b + c + d end

y + x + y <=AC a + a + c + d end

x <=AC a+b+b+b+c+a+c & x <=AC b+a+c+b+b+a+c end

x <=AC a+b+b+c+a+c & x <=AC b+a+c+b+b+a+c end

x +y+y <=AC a+a+b+b end

x + y + z + v <=AC a + b + c + d + e + f + g   end

